    "en": {
      "trackName": "Solitaire Watch",
      "description": "Solitaire Watch brings classic solitaire back to Apple Watch and iPhone with quick sessions, readable cards, and smooth modern play.\n\nPlay Klondike in 1-card or 3-card mode, choose one-touch or two-touch controls, and jump back into saved games instantly. Every day features a verified solvable Daily Challenge, so every player tackles the same winnable hand.\n\nFeatures:\n- Apple Watch and iPhone gameplay\n- Daily Challenge built from verified solvable Klondike hands\n- Klondike in 1-card and 3-card modes\n- Spiderette as an optional unlock for players who want a tougher variant\n- Hints, undo, auto-complete, move tracking, and best-time history\n- Deck customization with collectible card packs\n- Fast resume and reliable save/restore\n\nBuilt for short watch sessions, full-screen iPhone play, and the satisfying feel of solitaire anywhere.",
      "releaseNotes": "Solitaire Watch returns with a full modern refresh.\n\n- Rebuilt Apple Watch gameplay for current watch sizes\n- Modern iPhone layout with settings and animation parity\n- Daily Challenge using verified solvable Klondike hands\n- Shared progression, move/time tracking, hinting, undo, and auto-complete\n- Spiderette mode and updated card-style support",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/solitaire-watch/id954158465?uo=4",
